    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market this superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom home, No. 7 Parklands Gables. Ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Parklands development, this impressive property extends to approximately 118 sq. m. and combines generous proportions, high-quality finishes and excellent energy efficiency, having achieved an A-rated BER.\n\nParklands Boulevard is tastefully designed with a contemporary brick streetscape, while No. 7 enjoys a quiet and secluded position within the development. The property is presented in excellent condition throughout and is flooded with natural light, creating bright, airy and welcoming living spaces with a warm atmosphere throughout.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, guest w.c., large living room and an impressive contemporary kitchen/dining room with utility storage. Upstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a stylish family bathroom.\n\nThe spacious kitchen/dining area is a particular highlight of the home, offering a high-quality finish and an excellent setting for both everyday family living and entertaining. The large living room provides a comfortable and inviting space, while the generous rear garden enjoys a sunny orientation and offers an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining guests or enjoying a family barbecue.\n\nNo. 7 Parklands Gables is ideally located within this popular development, which enjoys a scenic backdrop of the Dublin Mountains while offering excellent access to Dublin City Centre and the surrounding areas. Saggart Village is just a short stroll away, as are the Citywest Hotel, Avoca and the Luas Red Line, with the first stop located close by.\n\nThe property is also within easy reach of Citywest Business Campus, Citywest Shopping Centre, two golf courses, shops, schools, sports and leisure facilities. Tallaght Village and The Square Shopping Centre are also nearby, while the recently opened Scoil Aoife primary school is located close to the development.\n\nExcellent transport links are available, with numerous Dublin Bus services providing access to Dublin City Centre. The property also offers easy access to the M50, N81 and N7, while the Luas Red Line provides a convenient connection to Dublin City Centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\n3D Tour - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=uamw7NbJ8PD\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Exceptionally stunning (A) rated double fronted property</li><li> 3 bedroom terraced property in turn key condition throughout c. 118 Sqm</li><li> 3 bathrooms including master en-suite</li><li> Huge scope to convert attic space</li><li> Large rear garden with sunny orientation</li><li> Ideally loacted in a secluded position in the development</li><li> Parking allocated in front of the property</li><li> Highly sought after location</li><li> Host of amenities and main transport links on your doorstep</li><li> Short stroll to Saggart village, shops, eateries such as Avoca</li><li> Easy access to the N7, M50 within minutes</ul>"
      },
